OL,3,GNEWSATrain derailment caused by 'kink'
OL,4,Ain the track
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train derailment was caused by a
OL,7,F"misalignment" or "kink" in the railway
OL,8,Ftrack, initial inquiries have found.
OL,10,FThe Greater Anglia service had been
OL,11,Fheading to London Liverpool Street from
OL,12,FSouthend Victoria, but came off the
OL,13,Ftracks about 2.1 miles (3.4km) south of
OL,14,FWickford station in Essex on 14 August.
OL,16,FIt remained upright, but its rear
OL,17,Fcarriage was dragged across sleepers
OL,18,Fand ballast for about 1.5 miles
OL,19,F(2.4km).
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
