OL,3,GNEWSATrain derailment caused by 'kink'
OL,4,Ain the track
OL,5,
OL,6,FSixty-two passengers were onboard and
OL,7,Fthe driving cab was rocked by the
OL,8,Fimpact at 14:08 BST, the Rail Accident
OL,9,FInvestigation Branch (RAIB) said.
